t ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as librairies) with details about everyhting: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to the website and learn things at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}]},{"text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Have a look ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki","type":"reference"},{"text":" to discover how OUDS works.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technicala architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For technical reasons the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"reference"},{"text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}]},{"text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not hesitate to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues","type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions","type":"reference"},{"text":"!","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"reference"},{"text":" GitHub repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}]}]}],"anc